<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> I'm having to fix PolyForth right now to handle it
<[Gary] GARY-S> My old FIG Forth did that, too
<[Kevin] APPERT> You can do a direct screen write on a PC with no difficulty.  
All you need is a LONG! and knowledge of the address
<[Hadil] H.SABBAGH> Why Dennis?  You shouldn't be using line 25
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> yes, the BIOS routines also have the problem
<[Hadil] H.SABBAGH> for emulation anyway.
<[Hadil] H.SABBAGH> Most systems want 24 line terminals.
