<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> however, the problem in when I use PolyForth windows
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> the terminal emulator sets line 24 as the last line
<[Kevin] APPERT> BIOS routines much too slow for screen output on PCs
<[Hadil] H.SABBAGH> Ah. I understand.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> then the app goes and writes to the end of the line
